{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17760","headline":"题贾巡官林亭 · 杨巨源","name":"题贾巡官林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白鸟闲栖亭树枝，绿罇仍对菊花篱。\n许询本爱交禅侣，陈寔由来是好儿。\n明月出云秋馆思，远泉经雨夜牕知。\n门前长者无虚辙，一片寒光动水池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}